<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Panamerican Beverage cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Panamerican Beverage cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said on Tuesday that it lowered its rating on the shares of Panamerican Beverages Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Panamerican Beverages Inc's was off 1/4 at 32-7/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
